+# Bug Fix: Authenticated customer shopping state
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Authenticated cart writes now associate carts with the logged-in customer and reject cross-customer cart access. Cart lookup, totals, checkout validation, and customer order pagination now preserve the required ownership and response semantics.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Resolve authenticated customers for POST/PUT cart operations and enforce cart ownership. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartRepository.java` | modified | Select open carts by merchant/customer and latest audit timestamps. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartServiceImpl.java` | modified | Use the merchant-scoped current-cart query. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderTotalApi.java` | modified | Preserve 404s and return a missing customer as 404 instead of 503. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Enforce checkout cart ownership and map nested amount-validation failures to HTTP 400. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepositoryImpl.java` | modified | Apply `customerId` to both order count and result queries. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Treat authenticated list arguments as page number and page size. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/utils/RepositoryHelper.java` | modified | Calculate page totals with ceiling division. |
+| `sm-core-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/model/common/EntityList.java` | modified | Return zero pages for an empty result rather than coercing it to one. |
+
+## Diff Highlights
+
+- Authenticated cart POST calls the customer-aware facade; authenticated PUT verifies the loaded cart’s `customerId` before modifying it.
+- Current-cart query filters `orderId is null` and orders by `dateModified`, `dateCreated`, and id descending.
+- Authenticated checkout unwraps the facade exception chain and sends the existing calculated-amount message as HTTP 400 without entering order creation.
+- Customer order queries now use `and o.customerId = :cid` for both count and data, with page size taken from `count`.
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No new automated tests were added; the repository has no existing authenticated cart/checkout/order fixture covering this complete flow. Existing shopping-cart and API integration suites were run as regression checks.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed after correcting checked-exception handling.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am test` → passed; sm-core 28 tests (0 failures, 13 skipped), sm-shop 33 tests (0 failures, 8 skipped).
+- Manual checks: source diff and JPQL/query ownership paths reviewed; authenticated end-to-end reproduction was not run.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+- The checkout facade wraps `ConversionException` in `ServiceException`, so the controller maps it by walking the cause chain rather than catching it directly.
+- The page-count correction is shared through `RepositoryHelper`, and empty-page semantics are corrected in `EntityList` because the authenticated order path uses those shared models.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add authenticated API integration fixtures for two customers, delivery tax, cart ownership, checkout amount mismatch, and paginated order results.
