+
+## Summary
+
+The changed reactor compiles and all available core/shop tests pass without failures. The required authenticated cart, totals, checkout mismatch, and customer-order API flows were not executed end-to-end because the repository lacks the necessary customer/payment fixture and documented running-service test procedure.
+
+## Checks Performed
+
