+| Regression suite | `mvn -pl sm-shop -am test` | pass | sm-core: 28 run, 0 failures, 13 skipped; sm-shop: 33 run, 0 failures, 8 skipped. |
+| Compile | `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` | pass | All six reactor modules compiled successfully. |
+| Diff hygiene | `git diff --check` | pass | No whitespace errors. |
+
+## Output Excerpts
+
+- `sm-core`: `Tests run: 28, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 13`
+- `sm-shop`: `Tests run: 33, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 8`
+- Maven reactor: `BUILD SUCCESS`
+
+## Residual Risks
+
+- End-to-end customer isolation, tax/address calculation, amount-mismatch response, and post-checkout current-cart behavior remain unverified against a live API.
+- The existing suite has skipped tests and does not assert the new response metadata/status requirements.
+
+## Recommendation
+
+Hold for authenticated API verification in an environment with two customer accounts, carts, delivery tax configuration, payment payloads, and order fixtures; then close if the four ticket scenarios pass.
